Think of being engulfed by an air elemental as an equivalent of being 
pulled into a tornado -- while you do suffer heavy damage, there is 
nothing that inherently tries to kill you.  The tornado simply treats you 
the same way as inanimate objects.  You get pummeled with debris, but 
except for the damage, there is nothing that is meant to kill you.
An equivalent would be pummelling someone with your fists as opposed to 
grabbing that person by their neck and strangling them.

On the other hand, digestion is meant to totally dissolve all digestible 
parts of the object eaten, and if it survives, something has gone wrong.

